  "body": "Hi, I found a TX power mismatch issue on LR2021 in sub-GHz mode.\n\nAt 868 MHz, the configured power and measured output differ a lot (especially at higher power settings), beyond normal tolerance.\n\nI have fixed it locally by updating LR2021 PA/TX configuration logic according to datasheet tables and half-dBm TX params.\n\nReference: https://github.com/hlym123/RadioLib/commit/f5a23d999a1d707938dbe24ae3e21a6558dda62b\n\nIf needed, I can submit this as a PR.",
